#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1118 expect=noViolation domain=DS
#note "The normal case: DSSTDTC is declared and populated -> the first not var_exists leaf is false and the sister is silent. DSSTDTC is Expected in SDTMIG and Required in every SENDIG, so essentially every real dataset lands here; the sister fires only on a structurally broken one."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DS class=EVENTS label="Disposition"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col DSSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DSTERM  type=Char label="Reported Term for the Disposition Event"
col DSSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Disposition Event"
---
S1 | DS | 001 | 1 | COMPLETED | 2020-03-01
